    <section-starting-page>
        <title>Aether Weaver</title>
        <description>
            A weaving framework for the JVM. A weave is an ordinary Java class that names the
            classes it changes; one engine applies it, and a driver decides when.
        </description>

        <spotlight>
            <a href="what-is-aether-weaver.topic" type="start"
